<title>USA: Anchorage, Alaska, $77 mln electric revs priced.</title>
<headline>Anchorage, Alaska, $77 mln electric revs priced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said Tuesday it tentatively priced $77 million of Anchorage, Alaska, senior lien refunding electric revenue bonds, Series 1996C, for Municipal Power &amp; Light, with a top yield of 5.60 percent in 2026.</p>
<p>The bonds are AMBAC insured.  </p>
